message: "If you use Weft, please cite the paper below."
title: "Weft: an execution ledger for autonomous coding agents"
abstract: >-
  Weft is a coordination and verification protocol for autonomous software
  agents, in which integration is gated by machine-checkable evidence bound to
  exact content rather than by human review.
